From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 23:51:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: t8132-j604: name the external
 display DARTs' clock protection

A deep sleep powers the J604's external display coprocessors off, and
iomfb_m4_ext_stop() takes each down whole: RTKit idle, the CPU stopped,
then its firmware DART and its display DART powered off through their
clock protection slices. The J604 named the slices of the firmware DARTs
(dcpext0/1) but not of the display DARTs, so the display DARTs had no
power-cycle state, the external DCPs refused every deep sleep at
"external DCP stop refused at DART owner: -19", and dispext1's DART
refused it again at genpd_suspend_noirq (-EBUSY), even with no display
attached.

Give dispext0's DART slice 4 and dispext1's slice 29. The J604's ADT has
the same T8132 pmgr node and the same dart-dispext0/1 nodes as the J713's
(only phandles differ), and the four slices the J604 already names match
the J713's; these are the J713's for the same DARTs.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604-lab.dtsi | 14 ++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604-lab.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604-lab.dtsi
index bae1d74ec8..75bfda1ffe 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604-lab.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604-lab.dtsi
@@ -1473,6 +1473,16 @@ &dcpext0_dart {
 	apple,clock-protection = <&ps_prot 0x05>;
 };
 
+/*
+ * The external display DARTs: a deep sleep powers them off with their DCP
+ * (iomfb_m4_ext_stop()), which needs their clock protection slices. The
+ * J604's ADT has the same T8132 pmgr tables and DART nodes as the J713's,
+ * whose slices these are (dispext0 4, dispext1 29).
+ */
+&dispext0_dart {
+	apple,clock-protection = <&ps_prot 0x04>;
+};
+
 &dcpext0 {
 	apple,pmc-interface = <&pmc_dispext0>;
 	#address-cells = <0x02>;
@@ -1546,6 +1556,10 @@ &dcpext1_dart {
 	apple,clock-protection = <&ps_prot 0x1e>;
 };
 
+&dispext1_dart {
+	apple,clock-protection = <&ps_prot 0x1d>;
+};
+
 &dcpext1 {
 	apple,pmc-interface = <&pmc_dispext1>;
 	#address-cells = <0x02>;
-- 
